<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 14.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 14.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Wednesday, May 14:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,500.80 (1,500.70)	CHF  1,045.00 (1,050.70)</p>
<p>    DEM    882.41 (887.04)	  GBP  2,436.40 (2,427.20)</p>
<p>    ATS    125.39 (126.00)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Tuesday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $14.88 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$15.19 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $30.07 million ($64.23 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
